            <ArticleTitle>Pain management: lessons from palliative care.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>226-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Reducing suffering and helping patients to control their symptoms are key components of palliative care. This commentary will offer a comprehensive definition of palliative care and will present a case history to illustrate how palliative care can benefit patients with chronic pain.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
